{
  "id": "PSA.74",
  "number": "74",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 74",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "74",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 74"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "74",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pour instruire. D'Asaph. Pourquoi, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.74.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.74.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", [nous] as-tu rejetés pour toujours, [et] ta colère fume-t-elle contre le troupeau de ta pâture ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Souviens-toi de ton assemblée, que tu as acquise autrefois, que tu as rachetée pour être la portion",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "de ton héritage",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", – de la montagne de Sion, où tu as habité.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Élève tes pas vers les ruines perpétuelles ; l'ennemi a tout saccagé dans le lieu saint.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tes adversaires rugissent au milieu des lieux assignés pour ton service",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; ils ont mis leurs signes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "pour signes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Un homme se faisait connaître quand il élevait la hache dans l'épaisseur de la forêt ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et maintenant, avec des cognées et des marteaux, ils brisent ses sculptures toutes ensemble.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils ont mis le feu à ton sanctuaire, ils ont profané par terre la demeure",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "de ton nom ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils ont dit en leur cœur : Détruisons-les tous ensemble. Ils ont brûlé tous les lieux assignés [pour le service] de",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "✶Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.74.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.74.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dans le pays.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nous ne voyons plus nos signes",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; il n'y a plus de prophète, et il n'y a personne avec nous qui sache jusques à quand.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jusques à quand, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.74.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.74.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! l'adversaire dira-t-il des outrages ? L'ennemi méprisera-t-il ton nom à jamais ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pourquoi détournes-tu ta main, et ta droite ? [Tire-la] de ton sein : détruis !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.74.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.74.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est d'ancienneté mon roi, opérant des délivrances au milieu de la terre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as fendu la mer par ta puissance, tu as brisé les têtes des monstres sur les eaux ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as écrasé les têtes du léviathan, tu l'as donné pour pâture au peuple, – aux bêtes du désert.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as fait sortir la source et le torrent ; tu as séché les grosses rivières.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "À toi est le jour, à toi aussi la nuit ; toi tu as établi la lune",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "et le soleil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu as posé toutes les bornes de la terre ; l'été et l'hiver, c'est toi qui les as formés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Souviens-toi de ceci, que l'ennemi a outragé l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.74.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.74.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! et qu'un peuple insensé a méprisé ton nom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne livre pas à la bête sauvage l'âme de ta tourterelle ; n'oublie pas à jamais la troupe de tes affligés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Regarde à l'alliance ! Car les lieux ténébreux de la terre sont pleins d'habitations de violence.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Que l'opprimé ne s'en retourne pas confus ; que l'affligé et le pauvre louent ton nom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lève-toi, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.74.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.74.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! plaide ta cause, souviens-toi des outrages que te fait tous les jours l'insensé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.74.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.74.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 74:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
